<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS4" title="In 5 Experiments ‣ Using predefined vector systems as latent space configuration for neural network supervised training on data with arbitrarily large number of classes" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.4 </span>Optimizing latent space dimension depending on n<sub class="ltx_sub">classes</sub></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Using predefined vector systems as latent space configuration for neural network supervised training on data with arbitrarily large number of classes" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Discussions</span></a>
