<td id="S5.T5.4.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">84</td>
<td id="S5.T5.4.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">cos (<a href="#S3.E11" title="In 3.3 Metric choice, loss and label functions ‣ 3 Latent space configuration methodology ‣ Using predefined vector systems as latent space configuration for neural network supervised training on data with arbitrarily large number of classes" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>)</td>
<td id="S5.T5.4.3.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">96.1</td></tr>
